GPT 6.2 Astra &amp; Gemini 4 Neon scored 450, the CSIT ceiling, leaving Korean models behind. This is Models &amp; Agents, episode 241. After that, a San Diego quantum compiler, NVIDIA's diffusion checkpoints, and things to try. Andthropic's Claude Fable 5.2 and Claude Opus 5.5, as you press reported, each scored 449.3 on that same 2027 college scholastic ability test.

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:36.740
or CSAT. Open AI's GPT 6.1 terror reached 445.8.

