Kimi's K3.1 Pro scored 438 after perfect results in Korean, English, and Korean history,

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:48.000
but 96 in mathematics and 92 in the Inquiry section.

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:54.300
Alibaba Group's Qwen Form Max achieved 100 points in Korean, English, and Korean history

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:58.160
yet 96 in mathematics and 88.5 in inquiry.

00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:09.920
LGAI Research's KX-1 2.5 landed at 414.7 and upstages solar mini 4.5 preview at 397.8,

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:13.620
35 points off the ceiling for the stronger domestic model.

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:22.560
The largest gaps appeared on image-based questions where GPT 6.2 Astra, Gemini 4 Neon, and GPT 6.2

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:32.386
Seoul, reached 100% accuracy, and Claude Fable 5.2, and Claude Opus 5.5, reached 99.4%.

00:01:32.386 --> 00:01:38.366
Researchers at the University of California San Diego, Rice University, Cuera Computing,

00:01:38.706 --> 00:01:43.246
Rochester Institute of Technology, and the University of Wisconsin-Madison, released

00:01:43.246 --> 00:01:49.526
Cubrio, Quantum Computing Report Notes, a multi-agent large language model, or LLM,

00:01:49.526 --> 00:01:56.006
Framework that compiles circuits for neutral atom quantum processors, and NURRIPS 2026 accepted

00:01:56.006 --> 00:01:56.506
the paper.

00:01:57.126 --> 00:02:02.226
Instead of hand-built heuristics rewritten whenever a processor layout changes, specialized

00:02:02.226 --> 00:02:08.106
LLM proposal agents, deterministic constraint verifiers, and a physical hardware simulator

00:02:08.106 --> 00:02:13.026
automate qubit placement, acoustic deflector routing, and schedule optimization.

00:02:13.026 --> 00:02:18.506
A three-level decomposition splits circuits into sequential controlled Z-gate stages,

00:02:18.946 --> 00:02:23.826
hand spatial placement, trajectory routing, and schedule refinement to separate agents,

00:02:24.346 --> 00:02:29.546
and returns localized spatiotemporal air diagnostics with transfer and decoherence feedback

00:02:29.546 --> 00:02:30.286
kept apart.

00:02:30.926 --> 00:02:36.246
Reasoning logs showed the agents found convoy-style shuttling on their own, using buffer traps

00:02:36.246 --> 00:02:41.506
and continuous multi-round motions so compatible qubits move in lockstep and cut spatial light

00:02:41.506 --> 00:02:46.466
modulator to Acusto Optic Deflector or AOD transfer penalties.

00:02:46.886 --> 00:02:53.246
On QazM bench workloads as large as 78 qubits, set against heuristic compilers and simulated

00:02:53.246 --> 00:02:56.706
annealing given 10,000 times larger evaluation budgets.

00:02:57.246 --> 00:03:02.286
Cubrio produced quicker execution schedules and better circuit fidelity, and it compiled

00:03:02.286 --> 00:03:04.266
stage batches in about 5 minutes.

00:03:04.946 --> 00:03:09.266
The open source Cubrio codebase is on GitHub with the full paper on archive.

00:03:09.266 --> 00:03:15.933
NVIDIA released 14 open 3 billion and 8 billion continuous diffusion language model checkpoints

00:03:15.933 --> 00:03:18.113
under the Nemotron Lab's Sigma name.

00:03:18.673 --> 00:03:23.873
Mark Tech Post reports that denoise text inside a learned 16-dimensional embedding space.

00:03:24.373 --> 00:03:29.713
The checkpoints distilled to few step samplers and decode up to 4.20 times faster than

00:03:29.713 --> 00:03:31.033
auto-regressive decoding.

00:03:31.982 --> 00:03:37.442
Connecting autonomous agents into Oracle databases, Oracle blog said, now runs through the

00:03:37.442 --> 00:03:42.742
model context protocol, or MCP, an agent to agent, or A2A standards.

00:03:43.502 --> 00:03:48.622
Agents can call tools directly on autonomous AI database instances without custom middleware.

